---
import Icon from './Icon.astro';
---
<section class="section" id="file-transfer">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="section-label">How transfers actually route</div>
    <h2 class="section-title">Two paths, chosen by what you're syncing against.</h2>

    <div class="ft-grid" data-reveal-group>
      <div class="card ft-card reveal">
        <div class="ft-flow">
          <span class="ft-node"><Icon name="devices" size={20} /> Device A</span>
          <span class="ft-arrow">→</span>
          <span class="ft-node ft-node-accent"><Icon name="cloud" size={20} /> Cloud provider</span>
          <span class="ft-arrow">→</span>
          <span class="ft-node"><Icon name="devices" size={20} /> Device B</span>
        </div>
        <h3>Cloud-mediated</h3>
        <p>Sync Pairs targeting a cloud account go through that provider's own API — the same as using the provider's own app or website.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="card ft-card reveal">
        <div class="ft-flow">
          <span class="ft-node"><Icon name="devices" size={20} /> Device A</span>
          <span class="ft-arrow ft-arrow-both">↔</span>
          <span class="ft-node"><Icon name="devices" size={20} /> Device B</span>
        </div>
        <h3>Direct LAN</h3>
        <p>Sync Pairs targeting a device, Nearby Share, and Universal Clipboard go straight between your two devices — never through a cloud provider.</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <p class="ft-callout reveal">Cloud sync uses provider APIs. Device-to-device never leaves your network.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .ft-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: var(--space-3);
  }
  .ft-card {
    padding: var(--space-4);
  }
  .ft-flow {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 10px;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    color: var(--accent);
    font-size: 13.5px;
    font-weight: 600;
    margin-bottom: var(--space-3);
  }
  .ft-node {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 6px;
    color: var(--text);
    background: var(--bg);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    padding: 6px 10px;
    border-radius: 999px;
  }
  .ft-node-accent {
    border-color: var(--accent);
    color: var(--accent);
  }
  .ft-arrow {
    color: var(--text-dim);
  }
  .ft-card h3 {
    font-size: 17px;
    margin-bottom: 6px;
  }
  .ft-card p {
    color: var(--text-dim);
    font-size: 14px;
    line-height: 1.6;
  }
  .ft-callout {
    text-align: center;
    margin-top: var(--space-4);
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--text);
  }

  @media (max-width: 767px) {
    .ft-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
  }
</style>
